{"id":"wb-3-40","name":"郭沫若故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"郭沫若故居","text":"郭沫若故居位于北京市西城区什刹海西面的前海西街18号，是郭沫若1963年到1978年之间居住的地方。后辟为郭沫若故居，1994年成立郭沫若纪念馆，并陈列郭沫若的生平和文学史学方面的成就。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%83%AD%E6%B2%AB%E8%8B%A5%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":91299397,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91299397","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6a4b089ccdef9bcd4721e271.jpg","title":"Gmrgj_2.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gmrgj_2.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e0/Gmrgj_2.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Original uploader was 用心阁 at zh.wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"​北京郭沫若故居大门。","width":320,"height":420}}